# Entries about JARVIS itself. Checked against ui.html, Logic.classify, Timers, Driving (v22 code).
E = [
("jarvis-what-is", ["jarvis voice assistant kya hai", "what is the jarvis assistant", "jarvis app kya kaam karta hai", "jarvis assistant kya kar sakta hai", "what can the jarvis app do", "jarvis ke baare mein batao"],
 "JARVIS ek Android voice assistant hai. Wake word bolne par ye torch, volume, apps, timer jaise phone ke kaam khud kar deta hai, aur zyadatar kaam bina internet ke chalte hain. AI keys optional hain.",
 "JARVIS is a voice assistant app for Android. After the wake word it does phone tasks like torch, volume, apps and timers, and most of them work without the internet. AI keys are optional.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-wake-word", ["wake word kaise badlein", "how to change the wake word", "jarvis ka naam kaise badalte hain", "wake word kya hota hai", "jagane wala shabd kaise badlein", "change wake word in settings"],
 "Settings mein WAKE WORD box mein naya shabd likho: sirf English akshar, ek shabd, 3 se 12 akshar, aur wo Vosk dictionary mein hona chahiye. SAVE ke baad STOP dabake dobara ACTIVATE karo. Shabd na mila to JARVIS khud jarvis use karega.",
 "In Settings type a new word in the WAKE WORD box: English letters only, one word, 3 to 12 letters, and it must be in the Vosk dictionary. After saving press STOP and then ACTIVATE again. If the word is not found JARVIS falls back to jarvis.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-offline-works", ["jarvis bina internet ke kya kya karta hai", "what works offline in jarvis", "offline mein jarvis kya kar sakta hai", "internet na ho to jarvis kaam karega kya", "does jarvis work without internet", "jarvis offline commands"],
 "Bina internet ke torch, volume, brightness, battery, samay aur tarikh, app kholna, timer, calculation, unit badalna aur pehli madad ke jawab chalte hain. Lambe khule sawal aur web search ke liye internet aur key chahiye.",
 "Without internet these work: torch, volume, brightness, battery, time and date, opening apps, timers, calculations, unit conversion and first-aid answers. Long open questions and web search need the internet and a key.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-no-key-needed", ["kya jarvis chalane ke liye api key chahiye", "does jarvis need an api key", "jarvis activate karne ke liye key zaroori hai kya", "bina key ke jarvis chalega", "jarvis ke liye key kyun chahiye", "is an api key required for jarvis"],
 "Nahi. ACTIVATE karne aur phone commands ke liye koi key nahi chahiye. Key sirf lambe sawaal, web search aur deep screen analysis jaise optional kaam ke liye hai.",
 "No. You need no key to activate JARVIS or to run phone commands. A key is only for optional things like long questions, web search and deep screen analysis.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-gemini-key", ["gemini api key kaise daalte hain", "how to add a gemini key in jarvis", "gemini key kahan daalni hai", "jarvis mein api key save kaise karein", "gemini key ka istemal kya hai", "keys save kaise karein"],
 "Settings mein GEMINI API KEYS box mein key paste karo (ek line mein ek key) aur KEYS SAVE dabao. Key Android Keystore mein encrypted rehti hai aur screen par wapas nahi dikhti.",
 "In Settings paste your key into the GEMINI API KEYS box (one key per line) and press KEYS SAVE. The key is stored encrypted in the Android Keystore and is never shown again.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-groq-key", ["groq key kya hai", "groq key kyun daalein", "what is the groq key for", "hindi samajhne ke liye kaun si key daalein", "groq save kaise karein", "better hindi listening ke liye kya karein"],
 "Groq key Hindi aur Hinglish behtar samajhne ke liye hai. GROQ KEY box mein paste karke GROQ SAVE dabao. Key hone par aapki awaaz internet se Groq ko jaati hai, aur wahi key free online text jawab mein bhi kaam aati hai.",
 "The Groq key helps JARVIS understand Hindi and Hinglish better. Paste it in the GROQ KEY box and press GROQ SAVE. With a key saved your voice goes over the internet to Groq, and the same key also serves the free online text answers.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-free-online-ai", ["free online ai kya hai", "jarvis ka free ai kaise kaam karta hai", "what is free online ai in jarvis", "groq openrouter pollinations kya hai", "free ai on karne se kya hota hai", "bina gemini ke jarvis jawab kaise deta hai"],
 "FREE ONLINE AI box mein switch ON karo to Gemini na ho ya fail ho jaye tab JARVIS Groq, OpenRouter aur Pollinations try karta hai. Sirf aapka bola hua sawaal text mein jaata hai. Pakka free rasta Groq ya OpenRouter key hai; Pollinations bina key fail ho sakta hai.",
 "Switch ON the FREE ONLINE AI box and, when Gemini is missing or fails, JARVIS tries Groq, OpenRouter and Pollinations. Only your spoken question is sent, as text. The sure free route is a Groq or OpenRouter key; Pollinations without a key can fail.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-privacy", ["jarvis mera data kahan bhejta hai", "is jarvis private", "jarvis privacy kaisi hai", "does jarvis upload my data", "jarvis kya cloud par bhejta hai", "mera data jarvis ke saath safe hai kya"],
 "Phone commands, shortcuts aur yaad ki baatein phone ke andar hi rehti hain. Screen ka text tabhi jaata hai jab aap bolo analyze screen aur key ho. Online AI ko sirf aapka sawaal jaata hai.",
 "Phone commands, shortcuts and remembered facts stay on the phone. Screen text is sent only when you say analyze screen and a key exists. Online AI gets only your question.", ["jarvis", "privacy"]),
("jarvis-analyze-screen", ["analyze command kya karta hai", "what does the analyze command do", "jarvis display ka deep analysis kaise karta hai", "deep analysis kab hota hai", "jarvis mere display ko kab padhta hai", "analyse command ka matlab"],
 "Analyze screen sirf tab chalta hai jab aap khud bolo, aur AI key ho. Tab password-free screen text AI ko jaata hai. Iske liye Accessibility ON honi chahiye.",
 "Analyze screen runs only when you say it yourself and an AI key exists. Then password-free screen text goes to the AI. Accessibility must be ON for it.", ["jarvis", "privacy"]),
("jarvis-confirm-yes", ["jarvis kaam karne se pehle poochta kyun hai", "why does jarvis ask yes or no", "risky kaam ke pehle haan kyun bolna padta hai", "jarvis ki confirmation kaise kaam karti hai", "jarvis ka yes confirmation kitni der rehta hai", "call karne se pehle jarvis kya poochta hai"],
 "Call ya WhatsApp bhejne jaise risky kaam se pehle JARVIS bol kar poochta hai aur sirf aapka saaf haan sunkar hi karta hai. Saaf na ho to ise na maana jata hai. Jawab ke liye 30 second milte hain.",
 "Before risky actions like a call or sending a WhatsApp message JARVIS asks aloud and acts only on a clear spoken yes. An unclear answer counts as no. You have 30 seconds to answer.", ["jarvis", "safety"]),
("jarvis-timer-help", ["jarvis se timer kaise lagayein", "how to set a timer with jarvis", "timer lagane ka tareeka kya hai", "jarvis reminder kaise lagate hain", "timer ke liye kya bolna chahiye", "jarvis mein countdown kaise chalayein"],
 "Bolo: jarvis set a timer for five minutes, ya jarvis do minute ka timer laga do. Timer phone ke Clock app se chalta hai isliye JARVIS so bhi raha ho to bajta hai. Alarm cancel karna abhi supported nahi hai.",
 "Say: jarvis set a timer for five minutes, or jarvis do minute ka timer laga do. The phone's Clock app runs it, so it rings even if JARVIS is asleep. Cancelling an alarm is not supported yet.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-shortcuts", ["jarvis shortcut kaise seekhta hai", "jarvis ka shortcut kya hota hai", "how does jarvis learn shortcuts", "shortcut banau ka matlab kya hai", "jarvis naye shortcut kaise banata hai", "jarvis memory clear kaise karein"],
 "Aap koi phrase baar baar bolte ho to JARVIS poochta hai ki shortcut bana du. Haan bolo to hi save hota hai. Shortcuts sirf phone mein rehte hain; Settings mein CLEAR MEMORY se sab hat jaate hain.",
 "If you often say a phrase, JARVIS asks whether to save it as a shortcut. It is saved only if you say yes. Shortcuts stay on the phone, and CLEAR MEMORY in Settings removes them all.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-personal-memory", ["jarvis ko kuch yaad kaise rakhwayein", "how to make jarvis remember something", "jarvis mujhe kya yaad hai kaise poochein", "jarvis bhool ja kaise bolein", "personal memory kaise kaam karti hai", "jarvis ki yaad ki baatein kahan save hoti hain"],
 "Bolo: jarvis yaad rakh mera naam Shiv hai; dekhne ke liye jarvis mujhe kya yaad hai; hatane ke liye jarvis bhool ja mera naam ya jarvis sab bhool ja. Ye sirf phone mein rehta hai, aur password, OTP, PIN, card ya ID number JARVIS yaad nahi rakhta.",
 "Say: jarvis yaad rakh mera naam Shiv hai; to see it say jarvis mujhe kya yaad hai; to remove it say jarvis bhool ja mera naam or jarvis sab bhool ja. It stays on the phone only, and JARVIS does not keep passwords, OTPs, PINs, cards or ID numbers.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-quiet-mode", ["jarvis jawab bolta kyun nahi", "how to hear jarvis replies aloud", "quiet mode kya hai", "jarvis ki awaaz mein jawab kaise sunein", "voice replies chalu kaise karein", "jarvis chup kyun hai"],
 "Shuru mein jawab chat mein dikhte hain, bole nahi jaate. Bolwane ke liye kaho voice replies on ya quiet mode off. Phir se chup karne ke liye quiet mode on kaho.",
 "By default replies are shown in the chat and not spoken. To hear them say voice replies on or quiet mode off. To silence them again say quiet mode on.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-driving-mode", ["gaadi chalate waqt jarvis kaise use karein", "jarvis drive karte waqt messages kaise padhta hai", "how does jarvis help while driving", "gaadi chalate waqt messages kaise sunein", "jarvis se message kaise padhwayein", "read messages aloud while driving"],
 "Bolo driving mode on. Phir JARVIS WhatsApp, Telegram aur Messages ke naye message padhta hai (read messages). Jawab ke liye reply driving, reply busy ya reply likho bolo, aur bhejne se pehle aapka haan chahiye; band karne ke liye driving mode off.",
 "Say driving mode on. JARVIS then reads new messages from WhatsApp, Telegram and Messages (read messages). To answer say reply driving, reply busy or reply likho, which needs your yes before sending; say driving mode off to stop.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-stop-words", ["jarvis ko chup kaise karayein", "how to make jarvis stop talking", "jarvis bol raha hai usse kaise rokein", "stop chup ruko kya karta hai", "jarvis ki awaaz band kaise karein", "jarvis ko beech mein kaise rokein"],
 "Bolo stop, chup ya ruko. JARVIS turant bolna band kar deta hai. Home screen par CHUP button bhi hai.",
 "Say stop, chup or ruko and JARVIS stops speaking at once. There is also a CHUP button on the home screen.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-accessibility", ["accessibility on kaise karein", "how to enable accessibility for jarvis", "accessibility ka kya fayda hai jarvis mein", "restricted settings allow kaise karein", "jarvis ko accessibility permission kaise dein", "why does jarvis need accessibility"],
 "Accessibility Home, Back, tap aur screen padhne jaise kaam ke liye hai. Android 13+ par pehle APP INFO mein jao, upar teen dot dabao, Allow restricted settings chuno. Phir ACCESSIBILITY ON KARO mein JARVIS ko ON karo.",
 "Accessibility is for tasks like Home, Back, tapping and reading the screen. On Android 13+ first open APP INFO, tap the three dots and choose Allow restricted settings. Then use ACCESSIBILITY ON KARO and turn JARVIS on.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-keep-alive", ["jarvis background mein band ho jata hai", "jarvis ko hamesha chalu kaise rakhein", "how to keep jarvis running in the background", "jarvis apne aap band kyun ho jata hai", "phone jarvis ko kill kar deta hai kya karein", "jarvis ka notification kyun dikhta hai"],
 "Ye aam Android salah hai: JARVIS ka notification chalne dein, app ki power setting Unrestricted karein, aur kuch brands (Xiaomi, Oppo, Vivo, Samsung) mein Autostart ya background allow karein. Menu ke naam brand ke hisaab se badalte hain.",
 "This is general Android advice: let JARVIS's notification stay, set the app's power usage to Unrestricted, and on some brands such as Xiaomi, Oppo, Vivo and Samsung allow autostart or background activity. Menu names vary by brand.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-permissions", ["jarvis kaun kaun si permissions maangta hai", "what permissions does jarvis need", "contacts brightness popup permission kya hai", "jarvis permissions kyun maangta hai", "allow contacts allow brightness kab dabayein", "jarvis ki permission list"],
 "Mic aur notification ke alawa baaki permissions tabhi maangi jaati hain jab aap Settings mein tap karo: ALLOW CONTACTS (naam se call ya message), ALLOW BRIGHTNESS (roshni badalna) aur ALLOW POPUP.",
 "Apart from the microphone and notifications, permissions are asked only when you tap them in Settings: ALLOW CONTACTS (call or message by name), ALLOW BRIGHTNESS (change brightness) and ALLOW POPUP.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-update-center", ["update center kya hai", "jarvis ko update kaise karein", "how does jarvis update itself", "jarvis ka sha 256 check kya hai", "update feed kya hota hai", "jarvis naya skill kaise add karta hai"],
 "JARVIS khud kuch install nahi karta. Ye aapke diye feed link par naya skill, model ya app dhundta hai, pehle aapse poochta hai aur SHA-256 check hone ke baad hi add karta hai. App install ke liye ALLOW APP INSTALL chahiye.",
 "JARVIS never installs anything by itself. It looks for a new skill, model or app at the feed link you give, asks you first and adds it only after the SHA-256 check passes. Installing an app needs ALLOW APP INSTALL.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-offline-model", ["offline brain kya hai", "jarvis ka offline model kaise download karein", "what is the offline model in jarvis", "qwen offline model kya hai", "bina internet ke ai jawab kaise milein", "offline brain download kitna bada hai"],
 "Optional offline model (Qwen2.5-0.5B, lagbhag 491 MB) Update Center mein OFFLINE BRAIN se Wi-Fi par download hota hai. Ye chhota model hai, galti kar sakta hai aur kabhi koi kaam khud nahi karta.",
 "The optional offline model (Qwen2.5-0.5B, about 491 MB) downloads over Wi-Fi from OFFLINE BRAIN in the Update Center. It is small, can make mistakes and never performs any action by itself.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-self-test", ["self test kya hai", "jarvis ka sab test karo kaise chalayein", "how to run the jarvis self test", "test report kahan dikhti hai", "jarvis sahi chal raha hai ye kaise check karein", "self test mein kya hota hai"],
 "Test apne aap chalta hai: app install hone ke baad pehli baar mic permission milte hi, aur har naye version par. Aapko koi button nahi dabana, torch ek second jalegi aur volume thoda badhega-ghategi, par koi call, message ya payment nahi hota. Report Settings ke TEST REPORT box mein hai; COPY REPORT ya SHARE se bhej sakte ho.",
 "The test runs by itself: the first time the mic permission is granted after install and again on every new version. There is no button to press, the torch lights for a second and the volume moves a little, but no call, message or payment is made. The report is in the TEST REPORT box in Settings; use COPY REPORT or SHARE to send it.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-screen-monitoring", ["monitoring feature kya hota hai jarvis mein", "monitoring feature ko on kaise karein", "what is the monitoring feature in jarvis", "jarvis mere display par error kaise batata hai", "monitoring ka matlab kya hai", "monitoring local hai ya cloud"],
 "Screen monitoring shuru mein OFF rehti hai. ON karne par ye phone ke andar hi screen par error ya warning dekhkar bol deta hai; kuch bhi cloud par nahi jaata. Iske liye Accessibility ON honi chahiye.",
 "Screen monitoring is OFF by default. When on, it watches the screen for errors or warnings inside the phone and speaks up; nothing goes to the cloud. Accessibility must be ON for it.", ["jarvis", "privacy"]),
("jarvis-wifi-bluetooth", ["jarvis wifi on kyun nahi karta", "can jarvis turn wifi on or off", "wifi bluetooth jarvis se kaise chalayein", "jarvis bluetooth khud on kyun nahi karta", "android app wifi ko on off kyun nahi kar sakti", "wifi on karne par settings page kyun khulta hai"],
 "Android kisi app ko Wi-Fi ya Bluetooth khud on-off karne nahi deta. Isliye JARVIS us ka Settings page khol deta hai aur wahan aap ek tap se badal sakte ho.",
 "Android does not let an app switch Wi-Fi or Bluetooth on or off itself. So JARVIS opens the matching Settings page and you change it with one tap.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-language", ["jarvis ki bhasha kaise badlein", "how to change jarvis's language", "jarvis hindi mein jawab kaise de", "jarvis english mein kaise bole", "awaaz ki bhasha kya hai", "jarvis ka jawab english mein kaise milega"],
 "Settings mein AWAAZ KI BHASHA se Hindi ya English chuno. Usi ke hisaab se JARVIS jawab deta hai.",
 "Choose Hindi or English under AWAAZ KI BHASHA in Settings. JARVIS answers in that language.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-voice-speed", ["jarvis ki awaaz tez ya dheemi kaise karein", "how to change jarvis's voice speed", "jarvis ki pitch kaise badalte hain", "awaaz test kya hai", "jarvis ki bolne ki speed kaise badlein", "jarvis voice pitch setting"],
 "Settings mein BOLNE KI SPEED aur AWAAZ KI PITCH ke slider hilao, phir AWAAZ TEST dabake sunlo.",
 "Move the BOLNE KI SPEED and AWAAZ KI PITCH sliders in Settings, then press AWAAZ TEST to listen.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-chat", ["jarvis se likhkar kaise poochein", "can i type to jarvis", "jarvis chat kaise kholte hain", "jarvis ko text mein sawaal kaise bhejein", "chat box kahan hai jarvis mein", "jarvis mein typing se baat kaise karein"],
 "Home par CHAT dabao aur JARVIS CHAT mein apna sawaal likho ya mic dabao. Jawab wahin dikhta hai.",
 "Press CHAT on the home screen and type your question in JARVIS CHAT, or press the mic. The answer appears there.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-knowledge-pack", ["jarvis offline kaun se sawaalon ke jawab de sakta hai", "what questions can jarvis answer offline", "jarvis ka knowledge pack kya hai", "jarvis general knowledge ke sawaal jaanta hai kya", "offline gk ke jawab jarvis kaise deta hai", "jarvis ke andar kya jankari bani hui hai"],
 "JARVIS mein India, vigyan, sehat, ganit, rozmarra aur khud JARVIS ke baare mein kuch sawaalon ke jawab bundled hain, jo bina internet ke milte hain. Ye sirf text jawab hain, koi action nahi karte. Aaj ki khabar ya bhav jaise live sawaal online jaate hain.",
 "JARVIS bundles answers about India, science, health, maths, daily life and JARVIS itself, available without the internet. They are text only and never perform actions. Live questions like today's news or prices go online instead.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-sleep-mode", ["jarvis neend mode mein kyun chala jata hai", "sleep mode kya hai jarvis mein", "what is sleep mode in jarvis", "jarvis sirf wake word par kyun jaagta hai", "kaam ke baad jarvis wapas so jata hai kya", "jarvis galat wake par kya karta hai"],
 "JARVIS sirf wake word sunkar jaagta hai aur kaam khatam hote hi wapas so jata hai. Ek akeli awaaz ya shor se nahi jaagta, aur galat wake par chup-chaap so jata hai.",
 "JARVIS wakes only on the wake word and goes back to sleep when the job is done. A lone sound or noise does not wake it, and on a false wake it quietly goes back to sleep.", ["jarvis"]),
("jarvis-default-assistant", ["jarvis ko default assistant kaise banayein", "how to set jarvis as default assistant", "power button dabake jarvis kaise jagayein", "home button se jarvis kaise kholein", "digital assistant app mein jarvis kaise chunein", "default assistant ka matlab kya hai"],
 "Update Center mein Default assistant dabao, phir Settings ke Digital assistant app mein JARVIS chuno. Uske baad Home ya power button dabake rakhne par JARVIS jaag jata hai.",
 "Press Default assistant in the Update Center, then choose JARVIS under Digital assistant app in Settings. After that, holding the Home or power button wakes JARVIS.", ["jarvis"]),
]
